## The RPG Battle System

You have a hero and a monster. They fight. The hero can attack, defend to reduce damage, or use items. The monster has a power level that determines how hard it hits.

### The Hero Struct

```xiom
type Hero = {
  name: Str;
  hp: Int;
  gold: Int;
}
```

### The Monster Enum

```xiom
enum Monster {
  Goblin,
  Skeleton,
  Dragon,
}
```

### The Action Enum

```xiom
enum Action {
  Attack,
  Defend,
  UseItem(item: Str),
}
```

### Monster Power

Each monster has a different power level:

```xiom
fn Monster.power(self) -> Int {
  match self {
    Goblin => { return 5; }
    Skeleton => { return 8; }
    Dragon => { return 20; }
  }
}
```

### Hero Takes Damage

```xiom
fn Hero.take_damage(self, amount: Int) {
  hp = hp - amount;
  if hp < 0 { hp = 0; }
}
```

### The Battle Function

```xiom
fn battle(hero: Hero, monster: Monster, action: Action) -> Str {
  let monster_power = monster.power();

  match action {
    Attack => {
      var damage = 10;
      hero.take_damage(monster_power);
      return hero.name + " attacks! Monster power: " + monster_power + ". HP left: " + hero.hp;
    }
    Defend => {
      var reduced = monster_power / 2;
      hero.take_damage(reduced);
      return hero.name + " defends! Reduced damage: " + reduced + ". HP left: " + hero.hp;
    }
    UseItem(item) => {
      if item == "Healing Potion" {
        hero.hp = hero.hp + 20;
        return hero.name + " drinks a " + item + "! HP: " + hero.hp;
      }
      return hero.name + " used " + item + ". Nothing happens.";
    }
  }
}
```

### Simulating a Battle

```xiom
var hero = Hero{ name: "Aria"; hp: 30; gold: 100; };
let monster = Monster.Goblin;

battle(hero, monster, Action.Attack);
battle(hero, monster, Action.Defend);
battle(hero, monster, Action.UseItem("Healing Potion"));
battle(hero, monster, Action.Attack);
```

### Adding Gold Rewards

```xiom
fn Monster.gold_reward(self) -> Int {
  match self {
    Goblin => { return 10; }
    Skeleton => { return 25; }
    Dragon => { return 100; }
  }
}

fn Hero.defeat_monster(self, m: Monster) {
  gold = gold + m.gold_reward();
}
```

You now have a complete tiny RPG: hero, monsters, actions, damage, healing, gold, and loot.

